<script id="metadata" type="application/json">{"pagecount":1,"title":"Blue and White Modern Job Offer Cover Letter","author":"Norlox Solutions Pvt.Ltd.","subject":"","keywords":"DAHEyHcPuV0,BAHBlB0K9Mo,0","creator":"Canva","producer":"Canva","creationdate":"D:20260323173533+00'00'","moddate":"D:20260323173532+00'00'","trapped":"","fileName":"Selection Letter TS final (1).pdf","bounds":[[909,1286]],"bookmarks":[{"title":"SELECTION LETTER","page":1,"zoom":"Fit","children":[{"title":"Dear {Candidate name},","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Date:","page":1,"zoom":"Fit","children":[{"title":"Following our comprehensive evaluation of your technical competencies and professional background, we are pleased to formally select you for the position of <b>{{ $letter->candidate_address }}</b> at                        The Tech System.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Your expertise has been identified as a high-value asset for our upcoming global project pipeline. By accepting this offer, you are officially integrated into our professional talent roster.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"1. Engagement Model & Compensation You are being onboarded into our Project-Ready Bench (PRB) Tier. Under this structured model, your formal employment status begins immediately for the purposes of orientation and client-alignment. Your competitive compensation, amount per hour, will commence and be billable upon your successful deployment to a client assignment.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"2. The Onboarding & Placement Guarantee To ensure a seamless transition into our Fortune 500 client environments, you will undergo a specialized Readiness Phase, including:","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Technical alignment and client-specific environment briefing.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Strategic resume enhancement and interview simulation.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Priority submission to our active project high-value roles.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"3. Terms of Acceptance This offer is contingent upon the successful completion of our onboarding formalities and the validation of your credentials.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"We are confident that your integration into The Tech System will be the catalyst for the next stage of your career. Please signify your acceptance by signing and returning this letter by <b>{{ \Carbon\Carbon::parse($letter->due_date)->format('dmy') }}</b>.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"},{"title":"Welcome to the team. We look forward to achieving great milestones together.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"}]},{"title":"Warm regards,  The Tech System Inc.","page":1,"zoom":"Fit"}]}],"thumbnailType":"","pageType":"html","pageLabels":[]}</script>
